<<
/Title (Nestora is a modular Kotlin-based microservice platform, where core features like user management, property listings, booking, property management, and notifications operate as independent services integrated via secure REST APIs. Key Integrations Payment Gateways: PayPal, Stripe, SSLCommerz External APIs: Google Maps API, Location API, Currency Exchange API Notifications: Firebase Cloud Messaging \(Push\), Twilio \(SMS\) Architecture Layers Presentation Layer: Kotlin Compose Multiplatform UI Business Layer: Spring Boot \(Kotlin\) Services Data Layer: MySQL, Redis, Elasticsearch Integration Layer: External APIs & Payment Gateways)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 936 0 R
>>
